{
  "about": "A role's Allow statements, inline and customer-managed, to the data stores and services they name: read/write/full, a wildcard resource as any:<service>. AWS-managed policies from the curated list (version 2), in any partition and with their path, as any:<service>. Near misses: a Deny statement, an underscore that is not a wildcard, an index ARN, an EC2 action, an AWS-managed policy with no data access (ViewOnlyAccess), a customer policy named like an AWS one. Version 3: a user, with its own inline policy and its group's inline and AWS-managed ones; the group itself draws nothing.",
